lean/round11 of shea256/fourier-transform-below-nlogn
Copyright 2026 Ryan Shea (for the additions listed below)

This directory is a subset of the Lean project github.com/chafreaky/wht-power-saving-lean at commit
fd19e46b728faa414cbfbf91b01a6a0b7903375d (Jacob Sussman's wht-power-saving-lean with Chafik Boukhalfa's
fourth result; Apache License 2.0), with files added. LICENSE and NOTICE in this directory are that project's,
unchanged; its NOTICE describes some files that are not included here. The 89 files under OAI/ and
third-party/openai-math/ are OpenAI's files from github.com/openai/math at commit fd4aeeb (Apache License 2.0),
unchanged. scripts/check_provenance.py verifies every upstream file byte for byte against the vendored archive
../../verification/vendor/five_stage/fourier-proof-source.tar.gz.

The helper circuit is Swapnil Jain's round-eleven complex word (github.com/Swapnil-jain/integer-mult-kappa at
commit 1a580dcc91dad5fbcffb5c80b7641a96bfa24e16; vendored with its LICENSE and NOTICE in
../../verification/vendor/jain_round11/), which builds on the community paired-cube construction of
CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds (see ../../ATTRIBUTION.md for the lineage).

Added files (new, or modified copies under new names):
- converter/word_to_gcert.py, converter/check_conversion.py: new. The converter follows the conventions of
  tools/emit/gcert_emit.py of the upstream project (Chafik Boukhalfa) and the semantics of Jain's checker.
- tools/certificate/gcert1-p11-jain-r11.json.gz: output of converter/word_to_gcert.py on Jain's word.
- Work/GCert/Data/*R11*.lean, Work/GCert/Data/Gen/R11*: generated by the unmodified upstream generators
  tools/gx/gxgen.py and tools/gx/gxrate.py from that certificate (as the upstream P193 and P233 files are).
- Work/FourierR11/*.lean (except Seam.lean, Axioms.lean) and comparator/UniformFourierR11.json: generated by
  tools/fourier/mkchainR11.py from OpenAI's unmodified files; each generated file states its changes.
- tools/fourier/mkchainR11.py, tools/fourier/regen_checkR11.py, Work/FourierR11/Seam.lean,
  Work/FourierR11/Axioms.lean: modified copies of upstream mkchain233.py, regen_check233.py and
  Work/Fourier233/Seam.lean, Axioms.lean; each says what was changed.
- Work/FourierR11Neg/UniformFourierChallenge.lean: the challenge with the exponent 1 - 6700001/10^10, a negative
  control only.
- scripts/, README.md, this file; .gitignore gained the line "build-logs/".

These additions were developed with Anthropic Claude (Claude Code). They have not had independent human review.
